{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"ArcaniaBot","id":"810907841329627137","is_bot":1,"username":"ArcaniaBot"},"author_id":"810907841329627137","channel_id":"851856616469823528","content":"**ArcaniaBot** command help *(Maintenance)*\nUse `?help [command]` for more info on a command\n\n__**Commands**__\n> `      cog`: Manage the bot's functionality modules\n> `     help`: Shows this message\n> `     here`: List all people last active in the current channel\n> ` longrest`: Mark yourself as going on a long rest, for the bot to notify you when it ends\n> `  message`: Add new scheduled message to the bot\n> `      ooc`: Have the bot remind people to keep ooc to ooc\n> ` reaction`: Add new emoji reaction to text triggers\n> `   reload`: Reload files with scheduled messages\n> `  restart`: Save state and restart the bot\n> `      say`: Make the bot say something in a specified channel\n> `  setrest`: Reset a player's long rest warning counter\n> `shortrest`: Mark yourself as going on a short rest, for the bot to notify you when it ends\n> ` shutdown`: Save state and close the bot\n> `   stocks`: Interact with stocks of Empire City companies\n> `    tasks`: Checks the status of automatic tasks\n> `     time`: Show current server time\n> `    where`: Show which channel someone was last active in\n\n*Made by Versil and hosted by Heki for Tales From Arcania season 4*","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:33:56.922000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865994746299285544","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
