{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851856616469823528","content":"!serveralias asc embed\n<drac2>\na2 = {'u': 'Untrained', 't': 'Trained', 'a': 'Ace'}\nc2r = {'c': 'Captain', 'p': 'Pilot', 'g': 'Gunner', 'm': 'Mechanic'}\nargs = &ARGS&\nif len(args) < 2:\n    T = \"Missing arguments\"\n    D = \"Call like !asc role level.\\nRole is c/p/g/m.\\nLevel is u/t/a.\\nE.g. !asc g a (gunner ace)\\nCan add adv or dis.\"\nelif args[0][0] not in c2r or args[1] not in a2:\n    T = \"Invalid argument(s)\"\n    a1_check = f\"Role must be the first letter or more of (captain/pilot/gunner/mechanic), e.g. pil, yours: {args[0]}\" if args[0][0] not in c2r else \"\"\n    a2_check = f\"Level must be u/t/a for untrained/trained/ace, yours: {args[1]}\" if args[1] not in a2 else \"\"\n    D = \"\\n\".join((\"!asc role level\", a1_check, a2_check)).strip()\nelse:\n    ch = character()\n    rc = args[0][0]\n    lv = args[1]\n    role = c2r[rc]\n    md, st = (\n        max(((charismaMod, \"CHA\"), (constitutionMod, \"CON\"))) if rc == \"c\"\n        else max(((dexterityMod, \"DEX\"), (wisdomMod, \"WIS\"))) if rc == \"p\"\n        else max(((strengthMod, \"STR\"), (intelligenceMod, \"INT\"))) if rc == \"g\"\n        else max(((dexterityMod, \"DEX\"), (intelligenceMod, \"INT\")))\n    )\n    T = f\"{ch.name} makes a {role} check ({st}, {a2[lv]})\"\n    D = []\n    ok = True\n    if lv == 'u':\n        D.append(\"Intelligence check:\")\n        ir = vroll(f\"1d20 + {intelligenceMod}\")\n        D.append(str(ir))\n        if ir.result.crit == 2:\n            ok = False\n            D.append(\"CRIT FAIL\\nThe station is disabled.\")\n        elif ir.total < 20:\n            ok = False\n            D.append(\"Untrained check failed.\")\n        else:\n            D.append(\"DC20 INT check passed.\")\n    if ok:\n        prof = (2 if lv == 'a' else 1 if lv == 't' else 0) * proficiencyBonus\n        dice = \"2d20kh1\" if \"adv\" in args[2:] else \"2d20kl1\" if \"dis\" in args[2:] else \"1d20\"\n        r = vroll(f\"{dice} + {md} + {prof}\")\n        D.append(str(r))\n    D = \"\\n\".join(D)\n</drac2>\n-title \"{{T}}\"\n-desc \"{{D}}\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T12:56:30.543000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867389577282846730","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"851856616469823528","content":"Server alias `asc` added.```py\n!alias asc embed\n<drac2>\na2 = {'u': 'Untrained', 't': 'Trained', 'a': 'Ace'}\nc2r = {'c': 'Captain', 'p': 'Pilot', 'g': 'Gunner', 'm': 'Mechanic'}\nargs = &ARGS&\nif len(args) < 2:\n    T = \"Missing arguments\"\n    D = \"Call like !asc role level.\\nRole is c/p/g/m.\\nLevel is u/t/a.\\nE.g. !asc g a (gunner ace)\\nCan add adv or dis.\"\nelif args[0][0] not in c2r or args[1] not in a2:\n    T = \"Invalid argument(s)\"\n    a1_check = f\"Role must be the first letter or more of (captain/pilot/gunner/mechanic), e.g. pil, yours: {args[0]}\" if args[0][0] not in c2r else \"\"\n    a2_check = f\"Level must be u/t/a for untrained/trained/ace, yours: {args[1]}\" if args[1] not in a2 else \"\"\n    D = \"\\n\".join((\"!asc role level\", a1_check, a2_check)).strip()\nelse:\n    ch = character()\n    rc = args[0][0]\n    lv = args[1]\n    role = c2r[rc]\n    md, st = (\n        max(((charismaMod, \"CHA\"), (constitutionMod, \"CON\"))) if rc == \"c\"\n        else max(((dexterityMod, \"DEX\"), (wisdomMod, \"WIS\"))) if rc == \"p\"\n        else max(((strengthMod, \"STR\"), (intelligenceMod, \"INT\"))) if rc == \"g\"\n        else max(((dexterityMod, \"DEX\"), (intelligenceMod, \"INT\")))\n    )\n    T = f\"{ch.name} makes a {role} check ({st}, {a2[lv]})\"\n    D = []\n    ok = True\n    if lv == 'u':\n        D.append(\"Intelligence check:\")\n        ir = vroll(f\"1d20 + {intelligenceMod}\")\n        D.append(str(ir))\n        if ir.result.crit == 2:\n            ok = False\n            D.append(\"CRIT FAIL\\nThe station is disabled.\")\n        elif ir.total < 20:\n            ok = False\n            D.append(\"Untrained check failed.\")\n        else:\n            D.append(\"DC20 INT check passed.\")\n    if ok:\n        prof = (2 if lv == 'a' else 1 if lv == 't' else 0) * proficiencyBonus\n        dice = \"2d20kh1\" if \"adv\" in args[2:] else \"2d20kl1\" if \"dis\" in args[2:] else \"1d20\"\n        r = vroll(f\"{dice} + {md} + {prof}\")\n        D.append(str(r))\n    D = \"\\n\".join(D)\n</drac2>\n-title \"{{T}}\"\n-desc \"{{D}}\"\n```","created_at":"2021-07-21T12:56:30.570000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867389577395437630","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
